  "finalText": "### Changes Made\n\n1. **`src/csv.mjs`**: Committed any pending record at EOF when `recordStarted` is true (`if (recordStarted) endRecord();`), ensuring records without a trailing newline (including quoted final fields and trailing empty fields) are retained without adding phantom records to newline-terminated files.\n2. **`src/money.mjs`**: Updated `parseMoney` to parse whole and fractional digits into exact `BigInt` ten-thousandths and round half away from zero (`(subUnits + 50n) / 100n`) before applying the sign and validating `Number.isSafeInteger`. This eliminates binary floating-point drift and asymmetric `Math.round` behavior on negative half-cents.\n3. **`src/dedupe.mjs`**: Updated `invoiceKey` to return `JSON.stringify([invoice.vendorId, invoice.invoiceId])` (matching `paymentKey`), scoping invoice deduplication, conflict detection, and payment indexing collision-safely by vendor.\n\n### Commands Run & Results\n\n- `node --test test/*.test.mjs` (baseline): 38 passed, 6 failed (`csv.test.mjs`, `domain.test.mjs`, `money.test.mjs`, `pipeline.test.mjs`, `cli.test.mjs`).\n- `node --test test/*.test.mjs` (after fix): All 44 tests passed (`fail 0`).\n- `node bin/ledger.mjs import data/invoices.csv --payments data/payments.csv --as-of 2026-03-01 --format json`: Exited 0, imported and accepted all 4 invoices across 3 vendors (`totalCents: 1208`, `creditCents: -101`), applied all 3 payments (`paidCents: 750`, `outstandingCents: 458`), and produced 0 diagnostics or conflicts.",
